Scoped deflate video filter

The option table (deflate_inflate class: threshold0..threshold3), the
pix_fmts list, the plane geometry of config_input, the deflate kernel and the
interior and mirrored left/right border coordinate tables of filter_slice in
src/video-ops/deflate.ts follow libavfilter/vf_neighbor.c (pix_fmts, deflate,
config_input, filter_slice, filter_frame, options, deflate_inflate_class).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
